 "faqs": [
  [
   "What are the benefits of pursuing an online UG/PG program?",
   "Online programs offer flexibility, accessibility and affordability. You can study from anywhere and fit learning around your schedule."
  ],
  [
   "How do I know if an online UG/PG program is accredited and recognized?",
   "Check that the program has accreditation from recognized bodies and look at the reputation of the institution. A Career Mantra counsellor can help you verify this."
  ],
  [
   "What technology and resources do I need to participate?",
   "A computer or laptop with internet access, plus any software, textbooks or platform access the course requires."
  ],
  [
   "How do online programs compare to on-campus programs in quality?",
   "Many online programs are taught by the same faculty as on-campus courses. Reviews, rankings and alumni feedback help you judge quality."
  ],
  [
   "Can I transfer credits to another institution?",
   "It depends on the receiving institution’s policies and on the accreditation of your program."
  ]
 ]
